::Pip Purpose::  
What is the primary purpose of pip in Python?  
{  
~ To compile Python code  
= To install and manage third-party Python packages  
~ To run Python scripts directly  
~ To create Python virtual environments  
}

::Installing a Specific Version::  
Which command correctly installs version 1.2.0 of a package called "example"?  
{  
~ pip install example>=1.2.0  
= pip install example==1.2.0  
~ pip install example~=1.2.0  
~ pip install example-1.2.0  
}

::Requirements File::  
True or False: The command `pip install -r requirements.txt` installs all the packages listed in the requirements.txt file.  
{  
= T  
~ F  
}
